2
00:10:37,894 --> 00:10:43,894
Educating Julie is a drama, documentary film directed by Gail Hardman.

3
00:15:56,842 --> 00:16:02,842
Julie is an English student assigned to write a paper about "nudity in the 80s".

4
00:21:15,789 --> 00:21:21,789
A bit overwhelmed at first she takes on the project by
visiting a nudist camping with her boyfriend.

5
00:26:34,736 --> 00:26:40,736
But while she learns about nudity and nudism, her
boyfriend struggles to keep up.

6
