12
01:03:47,368 --> 01:03:53,368
Educating Rita is a 1983 British comedy-drama film directed by Lewis Gilbert
with a screenplay by Willy Russell based on his 1980 stage play.

13
01:09:06,315 --> 01:09:12,315
The film stars Michael Caine, Julie Walters,
Michael Williams and Maureen Lipman.

14
01:14:25,263 --> 01:14:31,263
It won multiple major awards for best actor and best actress
and was nominated for three Academy Awards.

15
01:19:44,210 --> 01:19:50,210
Caine and Walters both won BAFTA and Golden Globe
awards for best actor and actress.

16
01:25:03,157 --> 01:25:09,157
The British Film Institute ranked Educating Rita the 84th
greatest British film of the 20th century.

17
01:30:22,105 --> 01:30:28,105
The film explores themes of research, england, interview, travel, nudism.

18
01:35:41,052 --> 01:35:47,052
The tone is emotional.
